# Afterglow Avenue, by DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and SZ. An original sunset-cruise synthwave song for the
# Synthwave style: a saw-lead hook built on a rising fourth (A-C-F-A), a square lead answering in the
# gaps, a 3+3+2 poly-stab groove, a syncopated FM-pluck arp, a warm pad, a syncopated synth bass, and
# the gated kit. The arp is the bank fm-pluck, which no Synthwave role uses: five eighth-note hits per
# bar (root, fifth, octave, third, ninth) with rests between them, so it doesn't share the style's
# continuous saw-pluck sixteenths. 108 BPM in A minor; the bridge and build lift the last
# chorus a whole step to B minor. The verse is half-time and the chorus opens up to four on the floor,
# so it sits between Midnight Arcade's moody 98 and Sunliner's 118 italo bounce.
#
# Every pitched part follows the chord map bar by bar. The chord symbols name the colour tones the
# melody leans on (G6, F6, A6, Dm7, Em7, G7, Am9) so a held 6th or 7th is not read as an accident.
# The pad drops the chord tone that would clash: the fifth of F6 under the lead's held D, and the
# third of Am9 under the held B. The bass stays on roots in octaves 1-2 under the kick.
#
# chords: F G6 Am C F G6 Am C
# chords @9: Am F C G Am F6 Dm E
# chords @17: Am F C G Am F6 Dm E
# chords @25: Dm7 Em7 F6 G7 Dm7 Em7 F6 E
# chords @33: F G6 Am C F6 G6 Am Am
# chords @41: F G6 Am C F6 G6 Am Am
# chords @49: Am F C G Am F6 Dm E
# chords @57: F G Am E
# chords @61: Dm7 Em7 F6 G7 Dm7 Em7 F6 E
# chords @69: F G6 Am C F6 G6 Am Am
# chords @77: F G6 Am C F6 G6 Am Am
# chords @85: F Gadd9 Am9 Am7 Dm Em F E
# chords @93: F# F# F#sus4 F#
# chords @97: G A6 Bm D G6 A6 Bm Bm
# chords @105: G A6 Bm D G6 A6 Bm Bm
# chords @113: G A6 Bm D G6 A Bm Bm
#
# Form: 1-8 intro (the arp teases the hook, then the saw states it); 9-24 verse 1; 25-32 pre-chorus;
# 33-48 chorus 1; 49-60 verse 2; 61-68 pre-chorus 2; 69-84 chorus 2; 85-88 bridge where the square
# lead echoes the lead a bar late; 89-92 the bridge builds; 93-96 the F# build; 97-112 last chorus in
# B minor; 113-120 outro: the motif once more, then a tag that ends on B.
#
# Human feel: phrase starts lean in 8-12 ticks, inner pushes come 2-4 ticks early, long notes settle
# late; stabs land 10-16 ticks late and uneven; off-beat hats push 4-6 ticks early; the bass keeps its
# downbeats on the grid and nudges only the little off-beat picks; velocities breathe with the phrase.
title: Afterglow Avenue
composer: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: synthwave
key: A minor to B minor
tempo: 108
time: 4/4
about: A sunset-cruise synthwave original at 108 BPM in A minor: a saw-lead hook built on a rising fourth, a square lead answering in the gaps, a 3+3+2 stab groove, a syncopated FM-pluck arp, half-time verses opening into a four-on-the-floor chorus, and a last chorus up a whole step to B minor.

